# apps/account environment template. Copy to .env.local for local dev,
# or set these via your CI's secret store for production builds.
# .env.local is gitignored; only .env.example is committed.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed env into the bundle at build time. That
# means each key below ends up in the published JS, which is FINE
# because each vendor's dashboard restricts the key by origin + chain
# + sponsorship policy. An attacker who extracts the key cannot use
# it for anything outside that allowlist.
#
# Recommended Stage 1 setup (this is the cheapest path on Base):
#   Bundler:   Pimlico                  (mature, permissionless.js native)
#   Paymaster: Coinbase Developer Platform (Base subsidy — $$ stays $0)
#
# Alternate: Pimlico for both. Set VITE_PIMLICO_SPONSORSHIP_POLICY_ID
# and leave VITE_CDP_API_KEY empty; chains.ts auto-detects which
# paymaster to wire from which env is present.

# ---- Pimlico (bundler — required) -------------------------------
#
# Get a key at https://dashboard.pimlico.io. The wallet runbook
# (docs/self-host-wallet.md) has the dashboard walkthrough; minimum:
#   - Allowed Origins:  https://id.kon.xyz (+ http://localhost:5175 dev)
#   - Allowed Chains:   8453 (Base mainnet), 84532 (Base Sepolia)
#   - Rate limit:       60 req/min
VITE_PIMLICO_API_KEY=

# Pimlico sponsorship policy id. ONLY used when VITE_CDP_API_KEY is
# empty (i.e. paymaster also goes through Pimlico). Leave empty when
# using Coinbase Paymaster.
VITE_PIMLICO_SPONSORSHIP_POLICY_ID=

# ---- Coinbase Developer Platform (paymaster — optional) ---------
#
# Get a key at https://portal.cdp.coinbase.com → Project → Paymaster
# tab. Coinbase paymaster on Base mainnet is heavily subsidized
# (free up to substantial volume); KON's $100 credit goes here.
# Dashboard allowlist (mandatory before going live):
#   - Allowed Contracts:  ENS Registry + Public Resolver
#   - Allowed Selectors:  setSubnodeOwner, setContenthash
#   - Allowed Origins:    https://id.kon.xyz (+ http://localhost:5175 dev)
#   - Global Max:         $100/mo
#   - Per User Max:       $5/day
#
# When this is set, chains.ts routes paymaster RPC calls to Coinbase.
# When empty, paymaster falls through to Pimlico (requires policy id
# above).
VITE_CDP_API_KEY=
